Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Imagine government services where AI agents don't just respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,They act, collaborate, and complete tasks for citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,But even a trusted agent can attempt an action it was never authorized to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:24.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,WAKALA verifies who the agent is, what authority it was given,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and whether this specific action is permitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:32.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it exceeds that authority, WAKALA stops it, before execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this isn't just a concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:39.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our working prototype enforces that decision through a real authorization gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:43.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,An authorized officer can contain the incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:47.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,restore valid authority, and let the legitimate service continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Security, without unnecessary disruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,WAKALA. Autonomous AI. Accountable actions.
